          "git_sha": "d56bc653936a770593b9e77a855c6432c6a5d49f",
          "line_end": 26,
          "line_start": 26,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "yanhua1010/build-your-own-coding-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/yanhua1010/build-your-own-coding-agent/blob/1e607dbb2f0819eda93d3d26d2dbb0b7089a3a2a/README.md#L26-L26"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a44332cc23b37bd98834cce4395a0f873d5facf5d0310f01f48d1b5a04cf0717"
      ],
      "text": "Each article maps to an independently runnable stage under steps/, starting from a ~100-line minimal loop and progressively adding tool execution, context management, and a TUI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fbfbc55506c3fcfbd5e825f61177e82e5fd819f48623321b8855bb0d9ee6c595",
